@api = http://localhost:5080

# Every endpoint except /api/health and /api/auth/* needs a signed-in session. Sign in through the
# app (Sign in with Steam), then copy the sift_session cookie from the browser into @session.
# Changes to a library are only accepted from its owner, and need the X-Sift-Request header.
@session = paste-sift_session-cookie-here

### Who am I signed in as?
GET {{api}}/api/auth/session
Cookie: sift_session={{session}}

### Sync any public profile (SteamID64, custom name, or profile URL)
POST {{api}}/api/profiles/sync
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: sift_session={{session}}
X-Sift-Request: 1

{ "identifier": "gabelogannewell" }

### Read a stored library (anyone signed in)
GET {{api}}/api/profiles/76561197960287930/library
Cookie: sift_session={{session}}

### Update a backlog entry (403 unless this is your own SteamID)
PATCH {{api}}/api/profiles/76561197960287930/games/620/backlog
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: sift_session={{session}}
X-Sift-Request: 1

{ "status": "Playing", "notes": "Co-op with Sam" }
